export anchor ImportLineBreaks:
    description:
        Linebreaks are allowed on imports/exports:

        ```piton
        \\\
        from ./file import
            FirstThing,
            SecondThing,
            ThirdThing
        \\\
        ```

        piton format will automatically add linebreaks to imports/exports if
        there are greater than 2 items or if the line exceeds 80 columns, and it
        will sort the imports.
